  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1f217371998349edaad70b517d04c8f0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue: {fileID: 765037708}
  speaker: A voice in your dreams
  speakerColor: {r: 0.7, g: 0.6, b: 1, a: 1}
  lines:
  - ...Magic was never meant to be divided.
  - Fire and stone. Wind and root. And storm. Once, they sang together.
  - Then the sects each claimed one song as the only truth, and forgot the rest.
  - Now something hungers for all of it. The Magic Eater devoured your sect, and
    your storm with it. Lightning will never harm it again.
  - Learn what the others know... or teach them to stand together.
  - Wake up.
  skip: 0
