--- !u!114 &943253441
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 943253439}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e7629b6d674ea0e45acefe96865cce5e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  displayName: Guildmaster Petra Stonebank
  title: Chair of the Earth Guild
  color: {r: 0.55, g: 0.4, b: 0.2, a: 1}
  lines:
  - Welcome to Terrabourne! Finest city on the continent, and bigger every season.
  - Earth magic raises walls, turns soil and moves mountains. Mostly, it turns a
    profit.
  - That creature is terrible for business. It ate the Deepstone Quarry whole - stone
    mages, contracts and all.
  - The floating rock over the crater? Squatters. We had a perfectly good claim on
    that valley before they, ahem, took it with them.
  - Tell you what. I'll teach you the Boulder, free of charge. Consider it an investment.
    Draw a square, like a nice solid foundation.
  linesAfterLearning:
  - Every outpost we build is one more thing that beast has to chew through. Go protect
    my investment.
  teaches: 1
  teachesElement: 2
