--- !u!114 &1022032725
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1022032723}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e7629b6d674ea0e45acefe96865cce5e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  displayName: Warlord Ignar
  title: Strongest of the Pyromancers
  color: {r: 0.6, g: 0.12, b: 0.05, a: 1}
  lines:
  - Another stray from the Storm Spire? Your sect was weak. That's why it got eaten.
  - Here the strongest rule. Magic is power, and power is meant to burn.
  - I took this throne by burning the last Warlord to ash. Whoever takes it from
    me will do the same.
  - That beast has swallowed three of our warbands. It drank our flames and spat
    them back at us.
  - 'You want fire? Fine. Draw the shape of the flame: a triangle. Let''s see if
    you burn brighter than your dead teachers.'
  linesAfterLearning:
  - Burn it all, little storm. The strongest rule.
  teaches: 1
  teachesElement: 1
