--- !u!114 &1448301673
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1448301671}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e7629b6d674ea0e45acefe96865cce5e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  displayName: Elder Wren
  title: Keeper of the Still Air
  color: {r: 0.75, g: 0.85, b: 0.95, a: 1}
  lines:
  - Welcome, traveller. Be at peace. Nobody raises a hand on Zephyr Isle.
  - You passed the crater below? That hollow was once our valley. Our home.
  - When the Earth Mages came to claim it, we would not fight them. We could not
    bring ourselves to.
  - So every one of us breathed as one... and we lifted the land we lived on into
    the sky.
  - They built their city on the crater's edge, as if daring us to come back down.
    We never will.
  - Our magic does not strike. It turns aggression back on the aggressor.
  - Draw a circle, and let the wind hold you. Whatever is thrown at you, it will
    return.
  linesAfterLearning:
  - 'Remember: the wind does not attack. It answers.'
  teaches: 1
  teachesElement: 3
