--- !u!114 &1753154993
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1753154991}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e7629b6d674ea0e45acefe96865cce5e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  displayName: Old Tamsin
  title: Survivor of the Storm Spire
  color: {r: 0.35, g: 0.32, b: 0.55, a: 1}
  lines:
  - You're awake... I thought the beast took every last one of us.
  - It came down from the north. From the Maw. It didn't just kill us - it ATE our
    storm. Swallowed the lightning right out of the sky.
  - Our magic won't touch it now. Not a spark.
  - The other sects still have their magic. The Pyromancers out east, the Druids
    in the north-east forest, the Earth Mages' city to the south-west...
  - And the Air Mages, if you can reach them. They say their island floats above
    the great crater.
  - Practice on those old totems first. Press Q to ready your wand, draw with the
    left mouse button, point at your target and cast with the right.
  linesAfterLearning: []
  teaches: 0
  teachesElement: 0
