--- !u!114 &2057507428
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2057507426}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e7629b6d674ea0e45acefe96865cce5e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  displayName: Elder Bramble
  title: Voice of Mother Nature
  color: {r: 0.2, g: 0.45, b: 0.15, a: 1}
  lines:
  - Shh. Listen... can you hear her? Mother Nature is grieving.
  - All magic flows from her. Fire, stone, wind, storm. Every sect forgets they only
    borrow what is hers.
  - The Magic Eater is a wound in her. It takes, and takes, and never gives back.
  - You carry the scent of a dead sect, child. Yet you came here with open hands.
  - Take her gift. Draw a V, like a seedling reaching for the sun, and the vines
    will answer - even if your enemy takes to the sky.
  linesAfterLearning:
  - Go gently, child. And give back what you take.
  teaches: 1
  teachesElement: 4
